# Modernization docs

When changing plan or architecture:

- Keep [STATUS.md](docs/modernization/STATUS.md) in sync—**Last updated**, phase, next up, blockers
- Final decisions go in [DECISIONS.md](docs/modernization/DECISIONS.md); open questions stay in its table until resolved
- [PLAN.md](docs/modernization/PLAN.md) changes are rare; note why in DECISIONS or STATUS session log
- Write for a future Cursor session with **no chat memory**—include enough context in STATUS session log

Use checklist `- [ ]` / `- [x]` in STATUS for phase progress.
